# Tab bar must stay uncovered by page content

**Goal:** Knowledge / Play / Progress fully visible; Play glass never covers them.

## Layout contract
1. `.tabs-inner`: `position: absolute; top/left/right: 0; bottom: var(--app-tab-bar-height); overflow: hidden`.
2. `ion-tab-bar`: `position: fixed; bottom: 0; z-index: 10000`; opaque `--ion-background-color`.
3. `--app-tab-bar-height: calc(50px + safe-area)`.
4. Play panel: `max-height: 100%` of shell — not `100dvh`.

## Why
`ion-page` is `position: absolute; inset: 0`. If `.tabs-inner` is full-height, pages paint over the tab bar even with high z-index on the bar in some WebKit cases. Insetting `.tabs-inner` bottom leaves a hard gap the glass cannot enter.

## What didn't work
- Flex column + z-index alone.
- Growing bar to 56px.
- Translucent glass tab bar.
- `max-height: calc(100dvh - tab-bar)` on the card while page still stacked over the bar.
